{"2611920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Unguided", "steam_appid": 2611920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/extras/c9d6f8fb2ee731cb008eb5bcfbf983b6.poster.avif?t=1787391661\" width=800 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/extras/c9d6f8fb2ee731cb008eb5bcfbf983b6.webm?t=1787391661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/extras/c9d6f8fb2ee731cb008eb5bcfbf983b6.mp4?t=1787391661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unguided is a challenging, fast-paced roguelite slasher with stamina-based combat drawing inspiration from Tron and 1980s sci-fi artwork and music. The game puts you in control of an inmate in a digital prison with only one way out - to get to the remote  server of the abandoned human cloning laboratory, upload yourself back into the blank body, and get revenge on the ones who framed you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/extras/b9736accc8a1a90a61e600566dc5f7b2.poster.avif?t=1787391661\" width=800 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/extras/b9736accc8a1a90a61e600566dc5f7b2.webm?t=1787391661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/extras/b9736accc8a1a90a61e600566dc5f7b2.mp4?t=1787391661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master unforgiving combat that requires precise timing and stamina management. Slash, shoot, and dodge your way through the PIT prison for a chance to live again.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine attack and defence routines  and execute cross-weapon combos to get the most out of your 1N-M8 stack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your personal codebase bit by bit, upgrade your 1N-M8 stack, and unlock permanent upgrades to change the way you fight and reach new areas of the PIT</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to the end of the ever-changing system, filled with humanity's most dangerous and twisted minds. Befriend the worst of them. Use raw Source Code to recover your  memories or help other inmates rewrite theirs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/extras/50522ac6552c487dd2152825f3263356.poster.avif?t=1787391661\" width=718 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/extras/50522ac6552c487dd2152825f3263356.webm?t=1787391661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/extras/50522ac6552c487dd2152825f3263356.mp4?t=1787391661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Welcome to the PIT, the most humane prison in the history of mankind. It's a one-way ticket designed with a simple goal in mind - keep the moralists at bay. You see, in 2037, we're executing criminals by the thousands, and apparently, that had upset a religion or two. But what if we could still permanently remove these elements from society, but you know... with all the &quot;thou shalt not kill&quot; part still intact? Enter the Personality Improvement Technology, once a long-buried human mind digitalization  program, and a savior to society nowadays. Problem solved - the &quot;immortal&quot; part gets sent to the PIT, and the body gets the good 'ol &quot;...have mercy on your soul&quot; treatment.&quot; - from the book &quot;How it's done: Albert Kramer's story.&quot;</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/extras/c9d6f8fb2ee731cb008eb5bcfbf983b6.poster.avif?t=1787391661\" width=800 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/extras/c9d6f8fb2ee731cb008eb5bcfbf983b6.webm?t=1787391661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/extras/c9d6f8fb2ee731cb008eb5bcfbf983b6.mp4?t=1787391661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unguided is a challenging, fast-paced roguelite slasher with stamina-based combat drawing inspiration from Tron and 1980s sci-fi artwork and music. The game puts you in control of an inmate in a digital prison with only one way out - to get to the remote  server of the abandoned human cloning laboratory, upload yourself back into the blank body, and get revenge on the ones who framed you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/extras/b9736accc8a1a90a61e600566dc5f7b2.poster.avif?t=1787391661\" width=800 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/extras/b9736accc8a1a90a61e600566dc5f7b2.webm?t=1787391661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/extras/b9736accc8a1a90a61e600566dc5f7b2.mp4?t=1787391661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master unforgiving combat that requires precise timing and stamina management. Slash, shoot, and dodge your way through the PIT prison for a chance to live again.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine attack and defence routines  and execute cross-weapon combos to get the most out of your 1N-M8 stack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your personal codebase bit by bit, upgrade your 1N-M8 stack, and unlock permanent upgrades to change the way you fight and reach new areas of the PIT</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to the end of the ever-changing system, filled with humanity's most dangerous and twisted minds. Befriend the worst of them. Use raw Source Code to recover your  memories or help other inmates rewrite theirs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/extras/50522ac6552c487dd2152825f3263356.poster.avif?t=1787391661\" width=718 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/extras/50522ac6552c487dd2152825f3263356.webm?t=1787391661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/extras/50522ac6552c487dd2152825f3263356.mp4?t=1787391661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Welcome to the PIT, the most humane prison in the history of mankind. It's a one-way ticket designed with a simple goal in mind - keep the moralists at bay. You see, in 2037, we're executing criminals by the thousands, and apparently, that had upset a religion or two. But what if we could still permanently remove these elements from society, but you know... with all the &quot;thou shalt not kill&quot; part still intact? Enter the Personality Improvement Technology, once a long-buried human mind digitalization  program, and a savior to society nowadays. Problem solved - the &quot;immortal&quot; part gets sent to the PIT, and the body gets the good 'ol &quot;...have mercy on your soul&quot; treatment.&quot; - from the book &quot;How it's done: Albert Kramer's story.&quot;</p>", "short_description": "Escape a digital prison, upload yourself back into the real world, and get revenge on the ones who framed you in this fast-paced, challenging roguelike slasher. [RUN], [suffer], [EOL], [RUN]", "supported_languages": "English, Ukrainian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/5bfbdf9f58c1ccc97cc9d402139cf2459b60fdbe/header.jpg?t=1787391661", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/44f8188f0437c4a7829e1c6847974a7e2ed31096/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787391661", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611920/44f8188f0437c4a7829e1c6847974a7e2ed31096/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787391661", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-8100 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 / AMD RX 560 (4GB VRAM) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2000 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600 or equivalent (6 cores)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1650 / AMD RX 570 (6GB VRAM) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versio